<body>
<SYNC Start=27580><P class='en'>Yo, listen up, here&#39;s a story
<SYNC Start=29500><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=30440><P class='en'>About a little guy that lives in a blue world
<SYNC Start=33320><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=34000><P class='en'>And all day and all night and everything he sees is just blue
<SYNC Start=37920><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=39200><P class='en'>Like him inside and outside
<SYNC Start=41040><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=41460><P class='en'>Blue his house with a blue little window and a blue Corvette
<SYNC Start=45380><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=46000><P class='en'>And everything is blue for him
<SYNC Start=48000><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=48420><P class='en'>And himself and everybody around
<SYNC Start=50660><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=51420><P class='en'>&#39;Cause he ain&#39;t got nobody to listen
<SYNC Start=53820><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=57320><P class='en'>I&#39;m Blue – da ba dee da ba dye, da ba dee da ba dye
<SYNC Start=60280><P class='en'>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=71040><P class='en'>I&#39;m Blue – da ba dee da ba dye, da ba dee da ba dye
<SYNC Start=74000><P class='en'>&nbsp;
